      "writtenOn": "2023-05-08T15:55:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Please refer b/269679145#comment33. Because when to do EC_RST(Reflash+PWRBTN) at AC only, we found the charger VDD didn\u0027t lower than POR falling level 2.5V(min.) during reset interval due to there was 2.6V residual voltage on VBUS_IN.\n\nThe 2.6V residual voltage during reset, caused EC still alive to run into this function even not connect the battery.",
      "parentUuid": "d32016c5_0cb43ad7",
      "revId": "10139944d9ec7df4e234b3d5423bd4761a706086",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
