      "writtenOn": "2023-05-08T21:17:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Reading the bug, it sounds like power+refresh doesn\u0027t reset the ec or the charger well. Thus, the ec keeps running after AC unplug, resulting in setting a bad value in 0x15. I\u0027m not convinced this is the right way to fix the bug. (It should be fixed in the HW.)\n\nDo you really need to support battery-less reboot for a shipped device?\n\nIf so, why don\u0027t you just define CONFIG_CHARGER_MAINTAIN_VBAT?",
      "parentUuid": "2e7631db_6ee13c5f",
      "revId": "10139944d9ec7df4e234b3d5423bd4761a706086",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
